# Suite nomenclature

- **Authority:** `docs/SUITE.md` (canonical in O-Studio repo; keep identical copies in O-CoreOp, O-Draft, and update all when terms change).
- **User-visible app names:** O-Studio, O-CoreOp, O-Draft, O-UI. Spell exactly; do not shorten to Studio, CoreOp, or Draft in menus, dialogs, or documentation.
- **Suite hub:** **O-Studio** (company, users, launch sibling apps). Do not refer to **OSAS**, **OSAS.exe**, or a separate launcher in user text.
- **Files:** company file = `.osas`; project file = `.osp`. **Take-off** is hyphenated in user text.
- **Assistant:** **Olmo 3 7B** on loopback **AI Core** `:8742`; O-Studio hosts; O-CoreOp and O-Draft are clients.
- **Not in user text:** AQC, AOS, AAD, AADT, ShilpiDB, Tulu, OSAS as a product name, OSAS.exe. Wire constants: `%LOCALAPPDATA%\O-Studio\`, `OSTUDIO_*` env vars, format ids `osp` and `studio-active-project` — see `docs/SUITE.md` and `Office.Shared.SuiteWire`.
- **O-UI:** shared WinUI library in repo **`o-ui`**, assembly **`O.Ui`** (`Hcw.Ui` / hcw-ui retired).
